<title>USA: Orbital Sciences gets $67 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Orbital Sciences gets $67 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>DULLES, Va. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orbital Sciences Corp said on Thursday it has received a $67 million contract from the U.S. Air Force Missile Systems Center to provide suborbital launch vehicles and services.</p>
<p>The contract is expected to involve up to 30 separate launches through 2001, the company said.</p>
<p>Orbital said it will design, develop, integrate and launch a variety of suborbital vehicle configurations -- from simple, unguided rockets to complex, guided missiles.</p>
</text>
